window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>SECOND EDITION with spicy adult content including extended, new, and revised scenes.</b></p> <p><i>Spicy enemies to lovers fantasy romance with an HEA.</i></p> <p><b>I'VE BEEN TAKEN PRISONER BY A MONSTER WITH A CROWN.</b></p> <p>Everyone fears the prince. Cold. Cruel. He has a thirst for his captives' blood. I'm everything this vicious royal despises. A wild captive in chains. The object of his hatred—and his obsession.</p> <p>Behind the prince's icy stare, forbidden temptation sets fire to my veins. But I'm not easy prey.</p> <p>A deadly escape. A fatal chase. Now we're trapped in a dark forest where lethal dangers prowl in the shadows. Forced into an alliance, we must fight to survive. Yet the longer we're isolated together, the hotter our passion burns. And if I'm not careful, I might claim something more dangerous than my freedom. I might steal his heart.</p> <p><b>This is a new couple in the Foolish Kingdoms world. Listeners are encouraged to start this series from the beginning. This is the fourth book in a scorching hot romantasy series with explicit sexual content and language. For listeners 18+ who want heavy steam, epic forbidden love, dark magic, and 'touch her and he'll unalive you' vibes.</b></p>"; 
